1
00:04:31,467 --> 00:04:34,707
[Venezuelan emigrant in Trinidad, VICE News; Spanish, English gloss]
It is hard, because you have to live afraid.

2
00:04:34,767 --> 00:04:37,987
You are working and worrying that immigration
will come, that the police will come.

3
00:04:38,547 --> 00:04:42,227
But even so, unstable as it is, it is
better to be here than in Venezuela.

4
00:04:42,347 --> 00:04:43,547
Yes, of course, totally.

5
00:05:57,360 --> 00:06:02,990
[President Trump, 3 January 2026]
Late last night and early
today, at my direction,

6
00:06:04,020 --> 00:06:11,510
the United States Armed Forces conducted
an extraordinary military operation in the

7
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:13,370
capital of Venezuela.

8
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:17,210
[President Trump, 3 January 2026]
The U.S. will now run Venezuela
during this transition period.

9
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:22,450
We're going to run the country
until such time as we can do a safe,

10
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:24,650
proper, and judicious transition.

11
00:06:37,733 --> 00:06:39,933
[Delcy Rodríguez, vice president, by phone on state TV; English interpretation]
We demand respect for international law.

12
00:06:41,183 --> 00:06:44,783
We condemn this brutal way,
savage aggression against our country.
